Z||000014||Archie||07-19-2000||01:44 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fieroshop:<BR><B>I am happy to announce that within a week or so I will have a kit for an 11 1/4 inch vented rotors. Price is still not set up. I do have the brckets that will hold the larger calypers for the rotors. How many of you are interested. <BR>I will be taking orders shortly and also in the works at my machinist being made is an alternative to ryan's anti-bump steer kit.<BR>Any takers. </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I've had all the adapter parts in stock for the 10-1/4" Vented system for more than a year now and no one seemed all that interested. I had them on my chop top car and all the Fieros I've driven since then.<P>I have enough of the adapters in stock to do about 20 cars. So at the rate they are selling, I figure I have enough to last a couple of years.<P>These have provisions for rear hand brake and fit '84 thru '87 Fieros.<P>Archie||||reg||1
