Z||000018||Archie||07-21-2000||06:30 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Archie:<BR><B> I've had all the adapter parts in stock for the 10-1/4" Vented system for more than a year now <P>Archie</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I must post a correction. For the first time in memory, I was wrong (once before I thought I was wrong but I was mistaken then).... I just noticed that I had said I had the 10-1/4 parts in stock, that was a typo.... I should have said I had the 11-1/4 parts in stock.<P>Oh, someone asked as to the cost of the adapters. I have the 4 adapters and instructions and part numbers for the other parts you'll need for $240.<P>Archie||||reg||3
